    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds of the Zodiac</strong> is a first-person narrative adventure where you play as <strong>Rei</strong>, a girl left alone after the passing of her grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/e8f8aff5d5d751cb9c0d4d635c6242ae.poster.avif?t=1755576055\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/e8f8aff5d5d751cb9c0d4d635c6242ae.webm?t=1755576055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/e8f8aff5d5d751cb9c0d4d635c6242ae.mp4?t=1755576055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rei gets contacted by the spirits of Zodiac, asking her for help with breaking their bond with the Jade Emperor, who keeps them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To free them, Rei must explore a mystical world, solve light environmental puzzles, and help the Zodiac spirits confront their personal struggles and sever the spiritual bonds that keep them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/78a3325a82f5ed6e10ad8d59a3ae3746.avif?t=1755576055\" width=612 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a <strong>beautiful rural Japanese village</strong> and cross into <strong>mystical realms</strong> tied to the Zodiac and the Jade Emperor. The game's visuals shift between grounded reality and colorful spiritual dreamscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/59d3100c78c59f9e186d77839e138ce1.poster.avif?t=1755576055\" width=612 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/59d3100c78c59f9e186d77839e138ce1.webm?t=1755576055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/59d3100c78c59f9e186d77839e138ce1.mp4?t=1755576055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/b3cd933ab270a44e5934a8f32aa7589f.avif?t=1755576055\" width=612 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relationships &amp; Bonds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/4d8d53795f55f7c7b2190f2ba16a61d4.poster.avif?t=1755576055\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/4d8d53795f55f7c7b2190f2ba16a61d4.webm?t=1755576055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/4d8d53795f55f7c7b2190f2ba16a61d4.mp4?t=1755576055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the twelve <strong>Zodiac spirits</strong> and uncover their emotional conflicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn about their ties to the Jade Emperor and help them find resolution.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/44bba562f71af8cdf255f44c99fa48ba.avif?t=1755576055\" width=612 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonds appear as <strong>tangible strings</strong>\u2014find ways to sever them and guide the spirits toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.5 to 2.5 hours</strong> of emotionally driven storytelling</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration and light puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue choices that shape Rei\u2019s relationships and story arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing, melancholic, and tense music tracks that evolve with the narrative</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>A free demo is available now! Try it and experience the world of Bonds of the Zodiac.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds of the Zodiac</strong> is a first-person narrative adventure where you play as <strong>Rei</strong>, a girl left alone after the passing of her grandmother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/e8f8aff5d5d751cb9c0d4d635c6242ae.poster.avif?t=1755576055\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/e8f8aff5d5d751cb9c0d4d635c6242ae.webm?t=1755576055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/e8f8aff5d5d751cb9c0d4d635c6242ae.mp4?t=1755576055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rei gets contacted by the spirits of Zodiac, asking her for help with breaking their bond with the Jade Emperor, who keeps them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To free them, Rei must explore a mystical world, solve light environmental puzzles, and help the Zodiac spirits confront their personal struggles and sever the spiritual bonds that keep them confined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805400/extras/78a3325a82f5ed6e10ad8d59a3ae3746.avif?t=1755576055\" width=612 height=344 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a <strong>beautiful rural Japanese village</strong> and cross into <strong>mystical realms</strong> tied to the Zodiac and the Jade Emperor. The game's visuals shi