    "short_description": "Trapped by the Jade Emperor, the Zodiac spirits reach out to Rei, a grieving girl drawn into a mystical realm. As she journeys through their world, Rei uncovers their personal struggles and helps them break free. A first-person narrative adventure filled with emotion, myth, and mystery.",
